    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [X] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.surround\n\n### Description\n\nIn `README` the default value for `config.search_method` is [cover](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.surround/blob/main/README.md?plain=1#L188). In the code it's also [cover](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.surround/blob/main/lua/mini/surround.lua#L701) but in help page it's [cover_or_next](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.surround/blob/main/doc/mini-surround.txt#L654).\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.10.0\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n.\n\n### Expected behavior\n\n_No response_\n\n### Actual behavior\n\n.",
